---

<DocsLayout
  title="Milestone 23 Qualification"
  description="Reproducible evidence for the qualified krabka Milestone 23 ecosystem stack."
  currentSlug="/docs/qualification"
>
  <div class="space-y-8 font-sans">
    <header class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">Milestone 23 Qualification</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
        The immutable linux/amd64 stack (krabka-broker v0.6.1) passed all eight gates: installation, operator lifecycle, CLI administration, observability recovery, disaster recovery, schema evolution, registry migration, and snapshot retention.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-3" aria-labelledby="qualified-components">
      <h2 id="qualified-components" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Immutable component set</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Qualified for <code class="text-krab-300">linux/amd64</code>. Source-only rows are built into or exercised against the published artifacts.</p>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10">
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm" aria-label="Milestone 23 immutable component set">
            <thead class="border-b border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-gray-400">
              <tr>
                <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Repository</th>
                <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Revision</th>
                <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Artifact digest</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
              {components.map(([repository, revision, artifact]) => (
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row" class="whitespace-nowrap px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-white">
                    <a class="hover:text-krab-400" href={`https://github.com/krabka-io/${repository}/commit/${revision}`}>{repository}</a>
                  </th>
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-gray-300">{revision}</td>
                  <td class="min-w-[16rem] break-all px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-gray-400">{artifact}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm" aria-label="Milestone 23 qualification gates">
        <thead class="border-b border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-gray-400">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Gate</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Status</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-5 py-3">Evidence</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
          {gates.map((gate) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row" class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-white">
                <a class="hover:text-krab-400" href={`https://github.com/krabka-io/krabka-broker/issues/${gate.issue}`}>
                  {gate.name}
                </a>
              </th>
              <td class="px-5 py-4 text-emerald-400">Passed</td>
              <td class="px-5 py-4">
                <ul class="space-y-1">
                  {gate.evidence.map(([label, url]) => (
                    <li><a class="text-krab-400 hover:text-krab-300" href={url}>{label}</a></li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">
      The gates ran in <a class="text-krab-400 hover:text-krab-300" href="https://github.com/krabka-io/krabka-broker/releases/tag/qualification-36293960620">qualification release 36293960620</a>. Revisions, image and package digests, and per-check SHA-256 values are recorded in the
      <a class="text-krab-400 hover:text-krab-300" href="https://github.com/krabka-io/krabka-broker/blob/main/qualification/milestone-23.json">final qualification manifest</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-2">Related Resources</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose pt-1">
      <a href={getPath('/docs/quickstart')} class="p-4 rounded-xl frosted-card border border-white/10 hover:border-krab-500/50 transition-colors block">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Quickstart Guide →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Run the qualified Milestone 23 stack locally using Docker Compose or Helm.</p>
      </a>
      <a href={getPath('/docs/broker/verification')} class="p-4 rounded-xl frosted-card border border-white/10 hover:border-krab-500/50 transition-colors block">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Verification Catalog →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">The Creusot proof ledger and Stateright model inventory that pull request CI reruns.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
